          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %p The definition is due to
          %ul
            %li#GabrielUlmer
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Gabriel"}> Pierre Gabriel
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Friedrich+Ulmer"} Friedrich Ulmer
              = succeed "," do
                %em Lokal präsentierbare Kategorien
              %strong 221
              (1971) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BFb0059396"}> doi:10.1007/BFb0059396
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=0327863"} MR0327863
          %p Textbook account:
          %ul
            %li{:id => "AdámekRosický94"}
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ji%C5%99%C3%AD+Ad%C3%A1mek"}> Jiří Adámek
